# The global ignore (core.excludesfile) carries `*.d` from a C template, meant
# for compiler dependency files. It also matches drop-in *directories*, which is
# how this repo stores config: uwsm/env.d, fish/conf.d. Without these negations
# a newly added drop-in is silently untracked and never reaches another machine.
!home/**/*.d/
!home/**/*.d/**
